## Remaining work

Request 3006 is closed for the body and header states described above.
`updateAcl`, `deleteAcl`, and `listAcl` remain unimplemented. Broader Phase 18
settings, input, error, control-flow, reverse-export, and platform
reconciliation also remains open. No Broker, Docker, or remote CI was used.
Pre-existing Phase 19 worktree paths remain unstaged and outside this slice.
